{"title":"【AI产品设计工作流】Codex工作流","slug":"vvw1zubidqspkfb5","html":"<div class=\"yuque-imported\"><h2 id=\"e7d4ec97\"><span><span id=\"uaec10e9b\">工作流总览</span></span></h2><div id=\"uebda7a0f\"><pre><code>① agents.md 设计说明书\n    → ② 装 Plugins（MCP）\n        → ③ 挂 Skills\n            → ④ 首轮生成（指令 + 灵感图）\n                → ⑤ Annotation 定点改\n                    → ⑥ 响应式 / 视觉 QA</code></pre></div><div id=\"u02e77f6f\"><hr id=\"FV9DD\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"9660ce98\"><span><span id=\"u58a02d38\">Step 1 · 写 </span><code><span><span id=\"u2a47c84f\">agents.md</span></span></code><span id=\"uacc3c724\">（项目设计说明书）</span></span></h2><p id=\"u7ad2dcdd\"><span id=\"ua9a701e6\" style=\";font-weight:700\">新建项目目录，放一份 agents.md：</span><span id=\"uf6d5954f\">\n</span><span id=\"uabb7f437\">视觉风格、色板 hex、字号层级、明确不要什么（如鲜艳渐变、玻璃拟态）。Codex 每个任务都会自动读它。</span></p><p id=\"u6329dc4e\"><span id=\"u7c698596\" style=\";font-weight:700\">为什么重要</span><span id=\"ubd08ce61\">:\n</span><span id=\"u263e57f6\">直接说「做个 dashboard」= AI 味满满；有说明书才有自己的设计系统。</span></p><p id=\"u0e09b25f\"><figure id=\"u55090417\"><img alt=\"\" data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1784123643221-f2ee2f97-bfad-4ace-8b47-31074915ae01.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/632f5930c1c3f9fce699ed3c.png\" width=\"543.5\"/></figure></p><div id=\"uaeb751a4\"><hr id=\"JUhK4\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"9598b7e0\"><span><span id=\"u4780b945\">Step 2 · 安装 Plugins（MCP）</span></span></h2><p id=\"uc5e8da4d\"><span id=\"ue1abffde\">打开 Plugins，安装下面的MCP插件：</span></p><div id=\"u8de57ab9\"><div id=\"qqGnw\"><div><div><div class=\"yuque-table-scroll\"><table style=\"width: 690px;\"><colgroup><col width=\"183\"/><col width=\"506\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><div><p id=\"ud356f9e9\"><span id=\"uf6b960ab\" style=\";font-weight:700\">Plugin</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u94827230\"><span id=\"ua45b6343\" style=\";font-weight:700\">用途</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"uc6623893\"><span id=\"u432d6515\">Product Design</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"ucad2af05\"><span id=\"u58aa36f5\">产品方向 / 用户流审计 / URL→本地原型</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u93db1494\"><span id=\"u5a5386e7\">Figma</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"uf7233b5a\"><span id=\"u22e29771\">设计稿 </span><span id=\"ubd9baecd\">↔</span><span id=\"u190b883e\"> 代码双向</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u7f6f913c\"><span id=\"udbcd8404\">Mobbin</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u38f2509b\"><span id=\"u6379f8a8\">按真实 App 屏借鉴交互模式</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u0ede660c\"><span id=\"u6edfa8e2\">Linear / Notion 等</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u6da8ffed\"><span id=\"ue88a98fc\">接你日常工具</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><p id=\"u000db999\"><figure id=\"u85498590\"><img alt=\"\" data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1784123645876-5e5536f1-159f-4dec-af88-6376bda71558.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/07c55fa9696cc87d460537eb.png\" width=\"543.5\"/></figure></p><p id=\"u35b74926\"><span id=\"u9c96fc8b\"></span></p><div id=\"u41900c0c\"><hr id=\"oNpuH\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"04a7b668\"><span><span id=\"ue0f87695\">Step 3 · 挂上设计 Skills</span></span></h2><p id=\"u68b7d670\"><span id=\"u0dcf2c26\" style=\";font-weight:700\">安装Skills：</span><span id=\"ua86cbfce\">\n</span><span id=\"u002ca4ea\">如Frontend Design 等，教会 Codex「什么叫好看、怎么打磨细节」。我另一篇笔记有详细写有哪些还用的skill，需要的话可以看看~</span></p><div id=\"u89f5f29a\"><a class=\"yuque-link-preview\" href=\"#/article/leqiuekdduhu6yxl\" id=\"uHusA\"><img data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1778402218854-8da24bd6-d6f3-453c-99a0-f6c063afcf8c.png?x-oss-process=image%2Fquality%2Cq_10\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/1cb6739a98f7c7cec91bfc24.png\"/><div><div>DESIGN.md 资源集合网站与聚合库</div><div>随着 AI 辅助编程（如 Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code）和“Vibe Coding”的爆火，DESIGN.md 这种将设计系统（颜色、排版、间距等）以 Markdown 格式直接喂给 AI 的规范在 2026 年迅速流行起来。它最初由 Google Stitch 等工...</div><div>任天真设计室 | AI全栈设计知识库</div></div></a></div><p id=\"ud5aca4ae\"><span id=\"uc4ba0d8a\" style=\";font-weight:700\">至此完成3个准备步骤 :</span><span id=\"u459ded0f\">\n</span><span id=\"u1cc6fe8c\">agents.md + 对的 Plugins + 设计 Skills → 才开始第一句 prompt。</span></p><p id=\"u7f3986f8\"></p><div id=\"u80539261\"><hr id=\"jm5su\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"3f5f378f\"><span><span id=\"u102a54f3\">Step 4 · 首轮生成（指令 + 灵感图 + 模型）</span></span></h2><p id=\"ua7025ce1\"><span id=\"u83471037\" style=\";font-weight:700\">做什么</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>1.</span></span><span id=\"u5fb9d120\"><span id=\"u034581f2\">模型用 GPT-5.5；复杂任务把 Reasoning 提到 High / Extra High</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>2.</span></span><span id=\"ua8811c00\"><span id=\"uaa1a2481\">首 prompt 写清：页面列表、尺寸、引用 </span><code><span><span id=\"u725cddab\">agents.md</span></span></code><span id=\"ucc325df8\">、</span><span id=\"ubf2bd52c\" style=\";font-weight:700\">附上灵感截图\n</span><figure id=\"u1f5ef076\"><img alt=\"\" data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1784122084765-1a1a9707-9b10-402d-8aee-834fe3afb4bd.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/c639dadae01eef4c44802553.png\" width=\"600\"/></figure></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>3.</span></span><span id=\"u63d0b44a\"><span id=\"u95252176\">可 </span><code><span><span id=\"ua7524732\">/</span></span></code><span id=\"ue7b211ed\"> 唤起 Product Design skill</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>4.</span></span><span id=\"u400929e9\"><code><span><span id=\"u2e696d5a\">agents.md</span></span></code><span id=\"u7753c3c7\"> 与灵感图别打架（一边 light 一边 dark 会翻车）</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>5.</span></span><span id=\"u4e0aa4e5\"><span id=\"udf79bd85\">简单项目可直冲交互原型；复杂项目先定视觉再加深</span></span></div><p id=\"u263d5268\"><span id=\"ub63dbad5\" style=\";font-weight:700\">示范 prompt 骨架</span></p><div id=\"u345b8df2\"><pre><code>Create a dark mode investment dashboard UI at desktop dimensions.\nInclude screens: Dashboard, Transactions, Budgets &amp; Goals, Analytics &amp; Reports, Settings.\nRefer to agents.md and the attached inspiration image.</code></pre></div><div id=\"ua42588cb\"><hr id=\"S6V4K\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"905e95f4\"><span><span id=\"u61532552\">Step 5 · Annotation 定点迭代</span></span></h2><p id=\"ua017b40c\"><span id=\"u2694e662\" style=\";font-weight:700\">做什么</span><span id=\"u66501bc3\">\n</span><span id=\"uddc24f54\">首版只是起点。开启 Annotate → 点选具体元素 → 只写改动（例：给图表加 XY 轴和 hover tooltip）。\n</span><span id=\"u9de7fc73\">少用「一条 prompt 改四五处」——容易只做对一半。</span></p><p id=\"u34fe338f\"><figure id=\"u5c89a451\"><img alt=\"\" data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1784123776019-60a1dd94-784f-42fd-a343-2159071a4f44.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/d215814eff43fbf92719ada9.png\" width=\"543.5\"/></figure></p><div id=\"u63872caa\"><hr id=\"OjT5v\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"38235f76\"><span><span id=\"u04b073d6\">Step 6 · 响应式检查 + 视觉 QA</span></span></h2><p id=\"u4b0e2dfe\"><span id=\"u3d6c98ac\" style=\";font-weight:700\">做什么</span></p><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>1.</span></span><span id=\"u7e2d5f3b\"><span id=\"u7a50409f\">设备工具栏切到手机尺寸——</span><span id=\"u3bfbc0ac\" style=\";font-weight:700\">响应式不会默认有</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>2.</span></span><span id=\"u4b601040\"><span id=\"u4b609e56\">用自然语言要求：补 mobile/tablet breakpoints，并要求</span><span id=\"u0b51b9b5\" style=\";font-weight:700\">肉眼检查每个断点</span><span id=\"u9e635f35\">（不是只扫代码）</span></span></div><div class=\"yuque-list-item\"><span class=\"yuque-list-marker\"><span>3.</span></span><span id=\"ubf83c58d\"><span id=\"uf34211d8\">生成阶段也可要求 AI 自己浏览器截屏做视觉 QA</span></span></div><p id=\"u23038f07\"><span id=\"ufc9c7c03\">Step6 切换设备视图Step6 修复前：挤成一团Step6 修复后：手机布局可用</span></p><p id=\"u8f8176a7\"><figure id=\"u060ffeeb\"><img alt=\"\" data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1784123542422-e4cce050-c33b-4978-95f7-7a4d1468f2c5.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/c0758caf8c2308140c4d2f29.png\" width=\"3588\"/></figure><figure id=\"u403b713c\"><img alt=\"\" data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1784123541325-5655d7da-ad0f-4ecb-bef5-0b3c8d5ce1f8.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/59329503573b590d8d9238af.png\" width=\"3588\"/></figure><figure id=\"u20f7b323\"><img alt=\"\" data-source-src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/1206632/1784123551706-41d1af3b-4caf-46ce-a875-bc3eb28e8c8b.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/yuque-import/65c000beb1f9df3d6895c525.png\" width=\"3588\"/></figure></p><div id=\"u23f86c4d\"><hr id=\"JhOQv\"></hr></div><h2 id=\"99abde76\"><span><span id=\"uff8d84a0\">加分：什么时候用 Codex，什么时候用 Claude Code</span></span></h2><div id=\"ub8bc8ac9\"><div id=\"cd0u6\"><div><div><div class=\"yuque-table-scroll\"><table style=\"width: 841px;\"><colgroup><col width=\"302\"/><col width=\"538\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><div><p id=\"u07cf9a1c\"><span id=\"u42fd2de9\" style=\";font-weight:700\">场景</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"ua2622b25\"><span id=\"u276c15e7\" style=\";font-weight:700\">更合适</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u8094205f\"><span id=\"ua71b8e6d\">要最漂亮的首稿、少设置</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u17ef214d\"><span id=\"ua6a4b1fd\">Claude Code</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"u88b51a2d\"><span id=\"u37dbf820\">Brief 清楚、省 token、技术型/多任务 review</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"udb0b5100\"><span id=\"uc480ccb4\">Codex</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr><tr><td><div><p id=\"ue51f9b15\"><span id=\"u816f84d8\">常见组合</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td><td><div><p id=\"u9ee3ad48\"><span id=\"u2a5604e2\">探索视觉用 Claude Code · 复杂代码库精执行用 Codex</span></p></div><div style=\"display: none;\"></div><div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div>","summary":"工作流总览 ① agents.md 设计说明书\n    → ② 装 Plugins（MCP）\n        → ③ 挂 Skills\n            → ④ 首轮生成（指令 + 灵感图）\n                → ⑤ Annotation 定点改\n      ","category":"Vibe Coding 工作流","topicId":"vibe-coding","tags":["Vibe Coding 工作流"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/abyssalsailor/yg90qa/vvw1zubidqspkfb5","updatedAt":"2026-07-15","order":157,"featured":false,"wordCount":722}
